  "description": "Burnt out and buried in work, Isaac Schrader drowns his stress in drinks with his only friend, James. The next morning, he wakes up in a hotel bed—hungover, disoriented, and far from alone. Lying next to him is Theodore Donovan, his charming yet insufferable roommate from their boarding school days… a man who vanished without a word years ago. Their reunion is anything but ordinary—and Theodore’s sudden return feels far from innocent. \n\nWhat is he really after?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
